I came across two strange messages recently while playing.  The first was
when I was eating a black pudding corpse in the mazes and was interrupted
by a gelatinous cube.  I was having a hard time getting it down (satiated).
I hit it once right after I stopped eating and got paralyzed.  But while I
was frozen, I got the message "You're finally finished."  The partly eaten
corpse was still there.  After I finished off the cube I continued to eat
the pudding corpse and again got the message "You're finally finished."
when I had really finished eating it.
The second odd message came a while later when I was in the castle.  I was
stepping over a pile of items when I got the message, "You trip over some-
thing.  You make a lot of noise!"  However, I was wearing speed boots and
gauntlets of dexterity (both identified), so it couldn't have been fumbling.
I am also certain that there was no magic trap there.  I was stressed, how-
ever.
Any ideas on how these messages came about?  The first one kinda looks like
a bug.
